=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary version</a> of <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Lion-headed_Belt_Buckle\" title=\"Item:Epic Lion-headed Belt Buckle\">Epic Lion-headed Belt Buckle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Immunity_to_Fear\" title=\"Immunity to Fear\">Immunity to Fear</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Immunity_to_Fear\" title=\"Immunity to Fear\">Immunity to Fear</a>:</b> The wearer of this item is immune to all <a href=\"/page/Fear\" title=\"Fear\">fear</a> effects.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Roar\" title=\"Roar\">Roar</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Roar\" title=\"Roar\">Roar</a>:</b> This item emits a frightening roar when melee attackers score a critical hit on the wearer, causing them to resist or be <a href=\"/page/Shaken\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shaken\">shaken</a> with fear.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +14</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +14</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +14 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +14</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +14</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +14 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Legendary_Desert&#39;s_Burning_Sun\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Legendary Desert's Burning Sun</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typ